1 Bain nargis ka tha ae hasan askari, <br>
Mujhko bewa kiya ae hasan askari.<br>
<br>
2 Beqabar is tarah haye kyun hogaye, <br>
Tumko kya hogaya ae hasan askari.<br>
<br>
3 Ae imame zaman dekho wiraniyan, <br>
Tum pe londi fida ae hasan askari.<br>
<br>
4 Pitte sar hai sab dekhiye uthke ab, <br>
Apke dilruba ae hasan askari.<br>
<br>
5 Woh sahqi kon the zeher yeh kyun diya, <br>
Kardiya ghar tabah ae hasan askari.<br>
<br>
6 Mujhse sadme na yeh uth sakege kabhi, <br>
Mujhko lijiye bula ae hasan askari.<br>
<br>
7 Kis tarah se shaha me jiyogi bhala, <br>
Hoke tumse juda ae hasan askari.<br>
<br>
8 Qabr par apki baith kar katongi, <br>
Yeh randapa mera ae hasan askari.<br>
<br>
9 Kuch na qoufe Khuda haye zalim kiya, <br>
Raaj luta mera ae hasan askari.